resolution: "Switched changelog:check to npm run changelog:full -- --check (delegating to the replace-mode render instead of inlining it) and changed release.yml CHANGELOG.md generate+check lines to --mode replace --all-release-tags."
expected_result: "npm run changelog:check passes against a replace-mode CHANGELOG.md; generation and verification share one render and cannot drift."
actual_result: "build, check, 92 tests pass; changelog:full regenerates idempotently; changelog:check passes."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:09:10.873Z",pi-agent,"Converging changelog generation/verification on replace mode. changelog:check previously inlined a replace-mode render; now delegates to `npm run changelog:full -- --check` so generation and verification cannot drift. release.yml CHANGELOG.md generate+check lines switched from --mode prepend --since-previous-tag --until-release-tag to --mode replace --all-release-tags (keeping --date and all other flags); release notes --stdout line left windowed. changelog:full already used replace mode."
close_reason: Converged changelog generation and verification on replace mode.
